","sub":"Chapter 4 · A headless server","short":"Storage","main":"The journal is persistent only if /var/log/journal exists.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Format","Storage","Dir exists","No dir"],"captions":["Binary format; a record has fields: text, priority, unit, boot id","The Storage setting decides where to write","auto and /var/log/journal exists: journal on disk, survives reboot","No directory: journal in /run/log/journal, empty after reboot"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"binary journal\nwith fields","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"binary journal\nwith fields","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"Storage=auto\npersistent\nvolatile","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"binary journal\nwith fields","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"Storage=auto\npersistent\nvolatile","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":95.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"directory exists:\non disk","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"binary journal\nwith fields","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"Storage=auto\npersistent\nvolatile","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":95.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"directory exists:\non disk","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":265.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"no directory:\nin memory only","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[11.3,18.7,30.2]}]},{"title":"journalctl filters","sub":"Chapter 4 · A headless server","short":"Filters","main":"Unit, priority, boot, time and format: all of them combine.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["-u and -b","-p and time","-b -1 -k","-o json"],"captions":["-u picks a unit, -b limits to the current boot","-p err..crit is a priority range; --since today sets the time","-b -1 -k: kernel messages of the previous boot","-o json -n 1: the fields of a record for scripts"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["journalctl -u nginx -b","journalctl -p err..crit --since today","journalctl -b -1 -k","journalctl -o json -n 1"],"hl":[0],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["journalctl -u nginx -b","journalctl -p err..crit --since today","journalctl -b -1 -k","journalctl -o json -n 1"],"hl":[1],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["journalctl -u nginx -b","journalctl -p err..crit --since today","journalctl -b -1 -k","journalctl -o json -n 1"],"hl":[2],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["journalctl -u nginx -b","journalctl -p err..crit --since today","journalctl -b -1 -k","journalctl -o json -n 1"],"hl":[3],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[8.4,19.6,28.1]}]},{"title":"Priorities and facilities","sub":"Chapter 4 · A headless server","short":"PRI","main":"The PRI number = facility × 8 + priority.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Urgent","Middle","Background","PRI"],"captions":["0 emerg, 1 alert, 2 crit, 3 err: time to act","4 warning, 5 notice: take note","6 info, 7 debug: background and debugging","165 = 20 × 8 + 5: local4, notice"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"0 emerg · 1 alert · 2 crit · 3 err","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"0 emerg · 1 alert · 2 crit · 3 err","tone":"red","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180